# Conference booth attract loop — a single 160MB video, above GitHub's 100MB
# per-file hard limit, so it cannot live here. ConferenceV3Booth falls back to
# /conference-media/<slug>/attract.mp4, so upload it to the deploy target (or set
# profile.conference.attractVideo to a hosted URL) for the booth's attract loop.
# The public marketing site does not use it.
public/conference-media/
